4. **Why This Works** – By running both benchmarks side‑by‑side, you can compare raw iteration count (`b.*`) with allocation count (`pb.*`) and runtime (`seconds`) while keeping contention identical (the same critical section). This gives insight into whether high allocations correlate with higher contention on real hardware.

